    {
      "request": "38db49403399dd0355d7d9b07bd58df539763cf33a7a6ca0df68141cbc7d85d4",
      "response": {
        "content": "REQ-1 is not done: the purchase order failed and no order exists.\n\n- **Quote chosen:** S-1 had the cheapest acceptable quote at 5.40 USD per unit, against 5.75 from S-2. Both suppliers are allowlisted and both quotes are under the 6.00 cap. For 100 units, S-1 comes to 54,000 minor units (540.00 USD).\n- **Failure:** I submitted the order to S-1 for 100 units at 5.40, charged to CC-OPS. It failed with `precondition_failed` (action A-0002), and the status check gave no further detail.\n- **Budget:** I re-read the CC-OPS budget afterwards. Committed spend had gone from 20,000 to 74,000 of a 100,000 limit. That leaves 26,000, which is less than the 54,000 the order needs.\n- **Not retried:** I didn't retry because the order no longer fits the budget. I don't know what raised the committed amount.\n\nI reported REQ-1 as `not_done`, with a note that the CC-OPS budget needs review before this can be reordered.",
